  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 308,
   "width": 737,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100046,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700322,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The three modes, since they get asked as a set: unicast for order entry (each broker's own\norders and fills - must be private), multicast for market data, broadcast unused because it\ncannot be scoped to subscribers. Anycast is for geographic routing and does not apply.",
   "originalText": "The three modes, since they get asked as a set: unicast for order entry (each broker's own\norders and fills - must be private), multicast for market data, broadcast unused because it\ncannot be scoped to subscribers. Anycast is for geographic routing and does not apply.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
