   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700420,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "interleaved with the deltas, so a\nsubscriber 50,000 messages behind (or\nnewly connected) resyncs from snapshot +\ndeltas, not 50,000 retransmit requests.",
   "originalText": "interleaved with the deltas, so a\nsubscriber 50,000 messages behind (or\nnewly connected) resyncs from snapshot +\ndeltas, not 50,000 retransmit requests.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 524,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100061,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700427,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The concession worth stating out loud: retransmission is INHERENTLY UNFAIR - whoever dropped a packet gets it later than\neveryone else. Accepted, because the alternative (hold every subscriber until the slowest acknowledges) makes the whole feed's\nlatency equal to the WORST subscriber's latency - worse for everyone, and unfair in a less obvious way. The rule is: the\nPRIMARY path must be simultaneous; recovery is best-effort.",
   "originalText": "The concession worth stating out loud: retransmission is INHERENTLY UNFAIR - whoever dropped a packet gets it later than\neveryone else. Accepted, because the alternative (hold every subscriber until the slowest acknowledges) makes the whole feed's\nlatency equal to the WORST subscriber's latency - worse for everyone, and unfair in a less obvious way. The rule is: the\nPRIMARY path must be simultaneous; recovery is best-effort.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
