   "text": "MSFT   BIDS                ASKS\n       415.00 x 1,200      415.02 x   800\n       414.99 x 3,400      415.03 x 2,100\n       414.98 x   900      415.04 x 5,000",
   "originalText": "MSFT   BIDS                ASKS\n       415.00 x 1,200      415.02 x   800\n       414.99 x 3,400      415.03 x 2,100\n       414.98 x   900      415.04 x 5,000",
